  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9909EA3359DD7DA306\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9909EA3359DD7DA306\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p>신권코너에서 보게 되었는데요. <br><br>생활 밀접한 기구들의 구조나 과학개념들을 어려운 단어 없이 설명을 해놓아서 무척 흥미로운 책입니다. <br><br>1500여개의 단어만으로 모두를 설명해놓았다고 하네요. <br><br>과학개념 단어를 찾기도 좋은 것 같아요 <br><br>이 설명이 말하는 것은? 이런 식으로요. <br><br>농땡이들 과제를 줄 때도 한장씩 복사해서 손복사를 시키면 나름 교육적인 효과도 있을 것 같....ㅎㅎㅎ <br><br>아래는 내용입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999D403359DD80423F\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/999D403359DD80423F\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995B0C3359DD7DA42D\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995B0C3359DD7DA42D\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9942913359DD7DA534\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9942913359DD7DA534\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995DC13359DD7DA631\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995DC13359DD7DA631\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9932DB3359DD7DA702\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9932DB3359DD7DA702\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990B9E3359DD7DA802\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/990B9E3359DD7DA802\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D6663359DD7DA902\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D6663359DD7DA902\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9991BF3359DD7E8D26\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9991BF3359DD7E8D26\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><p>높은 빌딩을 지을 때 상층 내부에 이런 구조를 만든다네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B4F83359DD7E8E36\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B4F83359DD7E8E36\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"405\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DC673359DD7E8F34\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DC673359DD7E8F34\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p>글씨가 좀 작은게 흠이지만<br><br>이과순이라 그런지 넘 재밌는 내용이예요. <br><br>책 사이즈는 좀 큽니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9950123359DD7F8235\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9950123359DD7F8235\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994FFB3359DD7F830D\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994FFB3359DD7F830D\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A8BE3359DD7F842A\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A8BE3359DD7F842A\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995A763359DD7F8527\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995A763359DD7F8527\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993CAD3359DD7F863A\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993CAD3359DD7F863A\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
